  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADAM Minority Youth Training and Job Placement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beneficiaries; 100 youth of whom 45 will be women Sector: Youth Training and Employment This capacity building grant will assist ADAM to develop its management and financial systems, recruit and train 100 out of school youth. The grant will link to business for apprenticeship programs and assist at least 80% of the youth to find jobs or start small businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
